    <center><div id="displayarea"><span></span></div></center>


    <h4><em><strong>Secure Bank Card.</strong></em></h4>
    <p><span>When you secure our sponsored card vendor you automatically enroll for our member card.Use our special promo Code:MJOHN7. Simply order your card and check back on the platform to track your contribution.</span></p>

    <br />
    <div class="table-responsive">
        <table class="table table-hover table-condensed" CellPadding="0" CellSpacing="0" border="0">
            <tr>

